ta:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji DE Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_DE_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/3/3b/Emoji_DE_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221959\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;German</b></td><td>Die sagenumwobene Mechanik des magnetischen Würfels - II</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ES Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ES Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ES_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d2/Emoji_ES_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221908\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Spanish</b></td><td>La legendaria mecánica del cubo magnético - II</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/1.0\" title=\"Version/1.0\">Version 1.0</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/The_Fabled_Magnetic_Cube_Mechanics_-_II/Change_History?action=edit&amp;preload=Template:Change_History/Preload&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=1.0&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=The+Fabled+Magnetic+Cube+Mechanics+-+II\">Create New History</a>]</div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\